abstract: >-
  A nine-unit Indonesian self-study reader on mathematical literature search,
  proof reconstruction, provenance, exposition, reproducible computation,
  errata, peer criticism, and bounded community contribution. Software,
  factual data, donor adaptations, and bundled browser runtimes retain the
  component-specific licenses stated in LICENSES.md. Produced with OpenAI
  Codex under Floris's direction.
keywords:
  - mathematics education
  - mathematical writing
  - research practice
  - reproducibility
  - proof reconstruction
  - Bahasa Indonesia
